WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:05.296
In the bottom half,
the pink babes have taken the field.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:06.881
He's hit the ball!

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.304
Out!

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:16.307
You've got to be kidding!

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:20.478
Hey! That chick took something out of
her wing and threw them at that guy!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:21.521
What?

00:00:21.646 --> 00:00:23.481
-What about it?
-Who do you think you are?

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.985
There's always some ugly prig
prattling about right and wrong!

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.403
What a priggish mouth!

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.655
What?

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:33.658
Well, if it isn't Ms. Tanuki.
Fancy meeting you here.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:37.829
I'm a mink! I'm not a weasel.
I'm Marie the mink.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.372
I haven't said anything.

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:42.375
-So who are you betting on?
-Bet?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.712
As usual, you don't have a clue.

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:49.174
Baseball in Anima-City
is a total gambling deathmatch.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.341
What?

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.178
It's beastman nature to want to win
even if you have to kill.

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:57.599
The flashier the kills, the happier
the fans are. That's what they bet on.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:03.897
Win or lose. Live or die.
That's Anima-City baseball.

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:05.023
You must be kidding.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:07.025
Okay! The babes are up to bat.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.028
With her flamingo swing,
she hits the ball!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.613
It happens to...

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:14.908
smash the pitcher!

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:18.036
It hammered Bears' pitcher, Winnie Poo.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.080
Poo's getting carried off on a stretcher.

00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:23.041
Oh, dear.
Without a pitcher, you're done for.

00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:25.460
There are only nine members on their team.

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:26.878
It looks like we won.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.379
Coach.

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.715
Coach.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.884
Coach!

00:01:34.302 --> 00:01:36.054
That's a hole in one!

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:40.558
That girl is our new pitcher.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.976
What? Me?

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.729
-No way! Impossible!
-You'll be fine. Just fine.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.564
Back her up, guys!

00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:47.899
Okay!

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.110
Bears have a new pitcher.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:53.279
She's clearly an amateur tanuki girl
they've forced onto the field.

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:55.573
-What do they want me to do?
-They're clearly shorthanded.

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:59.452
Hey, ugly! I'm talking to you, ugly!
Hurry it up, ugly!

00:01:59.577 --> 00:02:03.081
You're ugly and you are a tanuki.
That's so pitiful, I want to cry.

00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:06.793
But I've got a nail appointment later,
so I've got no time for sympathy!

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:11.464
If you're not going to pitch,
then go back home and build a mud boat!

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:15.844
You're the ones who are so disgusting
that it looks pitiful.

00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:16.928
What?

00:02:17.345 --> 00:02:21.599
How dare you mock the way people look
because they're born that way?

00:02:22.433 --> 00:02:26.604
Moreover, you pigeonhole them
to make yourselves feel superior!

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.362
That's a sexy strike!

00:02:34.779 --> 00:02:36.447
You've got to be kidding me!

00:02:36.531 --> 00:02:40.785
That's an unbelievably brilliant
miracle pitch!

00:02:41.369 --> 00:02:42.203
No way!

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:55.633
It's the bottom of the ninth.

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:58.136
With the bases loaded,
Bears have a chance to win this!

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:00.555
The batter is the tanuki
miracle-pitch girl!

00:03:00.972 --> 00:03:05.810
I've got to build a mud boat later,
so can you hurry this up?

00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:07.729
Why, you!

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.485
She's hit it!

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.154
It's gone!

00:03:16.654 --> 00:03:18.865
It's out of the park! I'm dumbfounded!

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:21.576
It's a come-from-behind win for Bears!

